  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"K\u0131l\u0131\xE7 Alt\u0131l\u0131s\u0131\" kart\u0131n\u0131
    \"ters\" se\xE7tin.\n\nBu karttan \u015Funu anl\u0131yorum {{isim}}; ya\u015Fad\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    birtak\u0131m olaylar i\xE7ine tam manas\u0131yla sinmemi\u015F. Hak etmedi\u011Fini
    d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCn muamelelere maruz kalm\u0131\u015F, istedi\u011Fin
    ve bekledi\u011Fin de\u011Feri g\xF6rmemi\u015Fsin. Kar\u015F\u0131 \xE7\u0131kmak,
    isyan bayra\u011F\u0131n\u0131 \xE7ekmek ya da t\xFCm ipleri koparmak yerine
    susup i\xE7ine att\u0131\u011F\u0131n \u015Feyler, stres seviyeni bir hayli art\u0131rm\u0131\u015F.
    A\u015F\u0131r\u0131 stres ise sende yorgunluk, sorumluluklar\u0131n\u0131 yerine
    getirme konusunda isteksizlik, cilt d\xF6k\xFCnt\xFCleri, ka\u015F\u0131nt\u0131lar
    ya da kar\u0131n a\u011Fr\u0131lar\u0131na neden olmu\u015F. Bu d\xF6nemde beden
    sa\u011Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131n i\xE7in faydal\u0131 olmayan al\u0131\u015Fkanl\u0131klara
    daha fazla y\xF6nelmi\u015F ve kendini bile isteye y\u0131pratm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n."
